<h1>Setup complete</h1>
<p>Your settings have been saved to <code>appsettings.json</code> and the database is ready.</p>
<p>Restart CrashDumpAnalyzer (or its Windows service) to activate the configuration. The setup wizard is now locked.</p>
<p>After restarting, <a href="@Url.Content("~/")">open CrashDumpAnalyzer</a> and sign in with the administrator account if authentication was enabled.</p>
